# 📊 Superstore Sales Dashboard

## Project Overview

This Power BI dashboard analyzes Superstore sales performance to identify trends, profitability patterns, and growth opportunities.

## Dataset

The Superstore dataset contains 21 columns, with the following relevant columns used for analysis:

- Ship Mode
- Segment
- Region
- Category
- Sub-Category
- Sales
- Profit

## Key Insights

- Total sales are approximately $2.3M, while profit is approximately $286K.
- Technology products generate the highest sales and profit.
- West and East regions perform better than South and Central.
- Sales increase toward the end of the year, indicating seasonal trends.
- Phones and Chairs are among the top-selling sub-categories.
- Standard shipping is the most frequently used shipping method.
- The Consumer segment contributes the highest sales, while Corporate and Home Office show opportunities for growth.

## Tool Used

- Power BI
